The first strict-Clippy run exposed the initializer warning described above; it
was fixed before this final gate. An early package-count probe compared 7 crate
package listings to all 8 workspace members; the corrected per-crate check
passed for all seven packaged crates. A metadata-report one-liner had a Python
f-string syntax error and was corrected; Cargo metadata itself passed.

